@page "/about"
@attribute [Authorize]

<PageTitle>@VersionInfo.DisplayName - About</PageTitle>

<h1>About</h1>

<p>
    @VersionInfo.DisplayName is a Windows-hosted service that lets an AI coding agent run
    <code>dotnet build</code>, <code>dotnet test</code>, and git commands against repositories on this
    host, and manage those repositories (clone, delete, browse, pull/push), without a local .NET
    toolchain of its own. It exposes an MCP (Model Context Protocol) server so an agent can call these
    capabilities as typed tools, and this dashboard for an operator to watch runs, browse history, and
    manage repositories directly.
</p>

